x   Point vectors are now available as a first-cut side artifact under <source-root>/../aerobag-artifacts/product-builds/shared/work/
x   vectors-2604/output/ . The current zip is vectors_2604.zip and contains separate tiled point files by layer:
x   point_tiles_airport_z9.json, point_tiles_fix_z10.json, point_tiles_nav_z9.json, point_tiles_awos_z9.json, and
x   point_tiles_obstacle_z12.json, plus stats.json and a small vectors manifest. Each tile file is a simple JSON object with
x   schema_version, zoom, and a tiles[] array; each tile has z/x/y and records[], and each record has id, kind, lat, lon, label, and
x   style_class. Current measured maxima are airport 107, fix 128, nav 9, awos 10, obstacle 286. This is also wired into the product
x   build graph, so the next successful build-product run will materialize the same vectors node in the normal shared outputs.

